OL,3,ADozens of suspected illegal miners die
OL,4,Ain Nigerian custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deaths have sparked disturbances
OL,7,Fincluding attacks on public buildings,
OL,8,Fand a 24-hour curfew has been put in
OL,9,Fplace in the state capital, Minna, as a
OL,10,Fresult.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
